{"uid":"9d16d8c7ab3300cb","name":"test_same_size_rewrite_of_a_later_covered_line_falls_back_exactly[silent-renders-identically]","fullName":"tests.test_hub_real_render_cap_whole_call#test_same_size_rewrite_of_a_later_covered_line_falls_back_exactly","historyId":"60cea9ac80ba8d3e8497d7278c3e1c5f","time":{"start":1791921518634,"stop":1791921518851,"duration":217},"description":"Task cure-01-03 second retry (PRD C.1/C.3, D.1, DoD 3-4): a same-size\n    rewrite of a covered raw line that is NOT the leading one -- here the\n    SECOND of three, a silent line the backward walk never reads for a\n    one-line tail -- made the index lie: turning it into a `text_delta`\n    'alpha' makes the full render suppress the later `message_end`\n    'beta' (already-streamed text), yet `ui_server.rendered_log_lines`\n    returned the stale 'beta' on both surfaces. Every checkpoint now\n    carries its raw line's CRC-32, and `render_index.load_index` verifies\n    the covered prefix's last `VERIFY_WINDOW_BYTES` (all of it here)\n    segment by segment -- bytes, fragment count, resulting state -- so the\n    index is refused and both surfaces answer the exact full-render tail.\n    The variants cover a rewrite that changes the render, one that\n    renders identically (a stale index is refused even when harmless),\n    a changed text on a line the walk DOES read, and the whole transcript\n    replaced by a same-size file through a rename.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task cure-01-03 second retry (PRD C.1/C.3, D.1, DoD 3-4): a same-size<br />\nrewrite of a covered raw line that is NOT the leading one -- here the<br />\nSECOND of three, a silent line the backward walk never reads for a<br />\none-line tail -- made the index lie: turning it into a <code>text_delta</code><br />\n'alpha' makes the full render suppress the later <code>message_end</code><br />\n'beta' (already-streamed text), yet <code>ui_server.rendered_log_lines</code><br />\nreturned the stale 'beta' on both surfaces. Every checkpoint now<br />\ncarries its raw line's CRC-32, and <code>render_index.load_index</code> verifies<br />\nthe covered prefix's last <code>VERIFY_WINDOW_BYTES</code> (all of it here)<br />\nsegment by segment -- bytes, fragment count, resulting state -- so the<br />\nindex is refused and both surfaces answer the exact full-render tail.<br />\nThe variants cover a rewrite that changes the render, one that<br />\nrenders identically (a stale index is refused even when harmless),<br />\na changed text on a line the walk DOES read, and the whole transcript<br />\nreplaced by a same-size file through a rename.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791921518617,"stop":1791921518617,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791921518618,"stop":1791921518623,"duration":5},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791921518623,"stop":1791921518624,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791921518624,"stop":1791921518628,"duration":4},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791921518628,"stop":1791921518628,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"a